WEBVTT

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.340
Good evening, everyone.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.880
It is time for our wildly popular lecture on the continent of Midgard.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.850
I, Solin of Kapra Service, will be your lecturer.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:24.340
Wildly popular? Where?

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:26.690
Ahem.

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:30.130
Tonight, let us discuss the Woods of the Lost.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.600
Oh, oh, oh! Why is it called
Woods of the Lost?

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.700
That is because anyone who enters these woods

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.630
can never find his way out again.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.360
Just as its name states? How boring.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.040
Anyhow, it is said that once a person gets lost in these woods,

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.340
he can never get out again.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.280
That is because they say

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.710
the Rule of the Left Hand is useless in this situation.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:55.480
Oh, oh, oh! Question!

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:55.880
--Isn't it better to use the right hand?

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.050
--The Rule of the Left Hand is that in any maze,

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.390
--if you walk with your left hand touching the wall,
--What? Hey! What are you going to do?

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:00.920
--From the looks of everything...

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.620
--you'll eventually reach the exit.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.660
--What is it that we can do?

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.000
I don't understand at all!
Did you hear me?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.500
Poo! You ignored me.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:12.670
If you use a fly's wings,

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:17.330
you'll eventually get out near the exit, anyway.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:28.010
So please enjoy wandering around the Woods of the Lost.

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.020
Sograt Desert...

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.800
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.770
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.270
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:53.780
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:59.580
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:03.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.630
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:18.930
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:24.470
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:31.610
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:37.090
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.520
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:46.460
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.730
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.800
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:55.300
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.840
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:05.650
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.550
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.780
Come, come, guys.
Pick up your feet.

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.680
Beyond these woods is Sograt Desert.

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.090
I have a feeling that we passed this way before.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:49.680
You're right.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:56.330
We passed here once... no, several times.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:04:01.800
What?! Have we been going in circles, then?!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:06.710
Right! Round and round and round and round...

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:07.640
No way!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.480
No, it's a fact.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:15.880
Oh, no! I've been walking all morning.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.320
Yuufa...

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.320
So please pull me.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:20.690
Huh?!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.990
Do your best.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.660
Yay! Comfy, comfy.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:45.480
Say, Roan, when will we get to Sograt Desert?

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:48.880
When we get out of these woods, I guess.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:51.520
Can we get out?

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.890
Well... We just have to.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.320
How?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:05:01.600
If I knew that... there'd be... no problem. Arghh!

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.260
Can't go on...

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:05.960
Roan, pull yourself together! Heal!

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.300
Yay! Comfy, comfy!

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.640
Heal!

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.310
Yay! Comfy.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:23.810
Heal!

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.260
Yay! Comfy!

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:32.330
Heal!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.660
Roan! Fight!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.000
Well, I'll be...

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.300
These things do happen, don't they?

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:44.240
Who would've guessed that we'd be lost in the Woods of the Lost?

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.640
What the heck? What the heck?
What the heck?

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:50.670
For all your big talk, we still got lost!

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.590
Come, I'll be your guide.
Just leave it to me.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:02.290
But the Woods of the Lost are dangerous.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:04.630
Wouldn't it be better to go the long way?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.600
Right. We should avoid whatever dangers we can.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.330
You don't need to worry.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.630
To me, these woods are like my backyard. My backyard.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:13.800
We can't get lost!

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:17.870
Okay, let's go.
Follow me, guys.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.970
Hurry, come on!

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:33.720
If she hadn't egged us on, we wouldn't be in this mess.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:38.530
Judia-<i>san</i> meant no harm.
What's done is done.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.930
Let's work together to think of a way...

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:43.160
...to get out of these woods as soon as possible.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.100
But once you get lost in the Woods of the Lost,

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.330
you're doomed to wander in here forever!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.270
Those two...

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.270
When did they become friends?

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:01.280
<i>I thought we could find</i> <i>our way out...</i>

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:18.970
I'm tired. My legs are stiff.
Roan, massage my legs!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:22.800
Are you crazy? I'm the one who needs a massage...

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.810
Please, Roan!

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.640
Okay, already. Keep qui-

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.610
Agh! Roan, don't fall asleep!

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:38.990
Massage my legs! Massage, massage.
You've just got to massage them!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:05.110
Honestly, your fear of bugs is such a pain, Iruga.

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:10.790
Honestly, without me around, you wouldn't be able to do anything.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.490
You can sleep, too, Iruga.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.620
I'll keep watch until morning.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.960
She'd better.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:43.150
Hey Iruga, it was fate, wasn't it?

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:47.220
The day that we met in the Woods of the Lost...

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:50.990
And how we're traveling together like this...

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.290
Yes-s-s!!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:27.260
Oh, well. We'll have to come back tomorrow.

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:29.960
Falco, come down!

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:38.810
<i>Back then, Falco and I would come</i> <i>every day to the Woods of the Lost</i>

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.210
<i>and hunt all day.</i>

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:45.050
<i>But my skills as a hunter</i> <i>just didn't improve.</i>

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:47.640
<i>Yes, it was on such a day...</i>

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:58.150
I'm sure I set the trap around here...

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:05.320
He wants my catch!

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.970
Good! He's here!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:14.340
Falco, go! Whoops.

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.340
"Regret..."

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.350
Doesn't mean anything.
It just fell out...

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.010
Come on, Falco!

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.190
Good! Attack once more!

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:54.720
Falco!

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:59.720
Falco, are you hurt? Where is it?
Show it to me!

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:06.330
<i>Falco's wound was worse</i> <i>than I expected.</i>

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:09.260
<i>My selfishness had</i> <i>caused Falco's injury.</i>

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:13.470
<i>When I realized that, I finally</i> <i>knew the meaning behind the card.</i>

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:15.600
<i>Overconfidence breeds regret.</i>

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:19.310
<i>You realize how much you cherish</i> <i>something only when you lose it.</i>

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:23.330
<i>"Fool." That was me.</i>

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:28.920
Falco, hang on. What'll I do?
Who could have imagined?

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:33.010
No, it's not my fault!
That card's to blame for everything!

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:40.960
Who are you?!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:44.170
What do you want, anyway?!

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:45.690
H-Hey!

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:55.280
Those who don't cherish life are unfortunate.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:56.710
Huh?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:07.320
Aagh! What're you doing?!
I set that trap!

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:11.490
We are not the ones who control the woods.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:14.100
We are given life by the woods.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.900
You're a poor hunter if you don't know that.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.770
Quit insulting people, will you?!

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:22.330
Who do you think you are, anyway?!

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:34.950
Just remember this!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:38.680
If I see you again, you'll be sorry!!

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:43.360
You really will be sorry.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:04.410
Afterwards like always, you know what to do.

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:06.310
Be counting on you!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:11.290
Now that Iruga's gone scouting, it'll be all right.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:14.310
We're practically out of these woods already.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.980
It's tiring to stand guard all night, after all. Huh?

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:26.660
Huh? You all look sleepy, too.
How come?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:32.870
Ah-ha. Were you listening when I was talking to myself?

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.710
I really have to watch out for you guys.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.910
A girl can't even talk to herself without everybody listening.

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:40.080
You call that "talking to yourself"?

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:44.020
Please tell us the rest!
We've got to know! We've got to!

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.460
Please, please, please?

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:52.020
Oh, what the heck. But I'm just "talking to myself," okay?

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:59.360
Ahem. Yes. After that, some time passed...

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:07.970
<i>Falco's wing healed,</i> <i>and he could fly again...</i>

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:12.310
Drat. I've come here again.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:15.380
Okay.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.320
Go! Go on!

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:27.760
Good. You're all right, now.
Isn't that great, Falco?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:32.000
<i>Falco soared lazily in the sky.</i>
<i>But I...</i>

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:36.740
<i>I didn't even know his name,</i> <i>but I wanted to see him.</i>

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:41.040
<i>I wanted to see him...</i> <i>so much... so much...</i>

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:44.350
We are not the ones who control the woods.

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:47.980
The woods give us life.

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:50.420
<i>When would I ever see him again?</i>

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:54.350
<i>How I longed for him.</i>
<i>That's when it happened.</i>

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.000
Heh, heh, heh, heh. Hey...

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.800
Right!

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:11.630
What do you want?!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.970
Girlie, let's be friends.

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.640
Don't underestimate me!
I'll mow you down!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.970
Eee-haaa!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:35.230
<i>They were bandits</i> <i>who roamed the area.</i>

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.860
Dammit!

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:57.350
Huh? She's awake? Heh, heh.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.150
Scram, you guys.

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:00.350
Right.

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:08.950
Yo, girlie. Alone, at last, huh?

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.930
Hey, don't run from me.

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:17.300
Girlie, love at first sight does happen, don't it?

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:25.050
I fell hard! Honest!
From the moment I saw you!

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.310
So be my wife!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.450
I pretty much did what
I wanted all this time.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:37.120
I led my crude band around, doing nothing but wicked things.

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.330
And I'll probably keep on doing wicked things.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.990
I'm a bandit, after all.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:47.330
So be my wife! Cheers to us!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.870
Hey, mister! Don't go planning my life for me!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:57.510
Be your wife? I'd rather die!!

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.510
What's that-

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:01.950
That's what I should say! Mister!!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.850
If I keep quiet, you keep making all the decisions for me!

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.690
Don't be ridiculous! You idiot!!

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:09.620
That's how you talk to your husband?!

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.960
Little bitch!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:25.370
Y-You're adorable...

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.970
Huh?

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:33.580
I just gotta make you my wife, cheers!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:34.980
W-Wait a minute!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.890
You ain't getting no sleep tonight, Baby.

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:43.480
We'll make the earth move. Let's go!

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:50.000
Cut it... <i>out!</i>

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:54.940
Make the earth move?!
Do it yourself, fool!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.600
You got guts, girlie.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.040
A bandit's wife has gotta be like that.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.370
Shut up!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.680
Heh, heh, heh.
I like you even more now.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:06.650
I just gotta make you my wife.
It's settled! The wedding's tomorrow.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:07.920
Okay? Okay?

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.320
--I'll kill myself!
--Huh?!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:12.950
If I gotta marry you,
I'll kill myself!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.860
I'll bite my belly button and die.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.760
Hah?

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:22.600
If you refuse me,
I'll bite my belly button and die.

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.230
Hah?

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:29.970
999 women have refused me.
You'll be the 1,000th.

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:34.240
Not even I can go on living if I get rejected by 1,000.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.910
That's why I'll bite my belly button and die!

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:39.580
Well?! Don't you feel like marrying me, now?!

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:42.150
You idiot! Who'd marry you?!
Go ahead and die!

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.650
Besides, you don't bite your belly button to die,

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.250
you bite your tongue!
Your tongue!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:47.620
Not only are you ugly, you're stupid, too!

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:48.990
That's it!

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.760
Girlie, here's my ultimatum.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:59.800
Be my wife, or be wolf food.
Choose. Which is it?

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.900
I'll be wolf food.

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:03.170
No hesitation?!

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:07.170
Fine! I'll throw you to the wolves, like you want.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:12.270
It's over. Sweet dreams,
Miss Number 1,000. So long.

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.470
Heh, heh, heh, heh, heh!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:43.240
Even the wolves are waiting happily for you!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.950
Girlie, you really don't wanna marry me?

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.050
You heard me!
Who'd marry you?!

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:49.980
Oh, yeah? So long.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.330
Eh, heh, heh, heh! Girlie!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.260
This is your last chance!
Now's the time to beg for your life!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.970
I'd never beg you for my life!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.990
Take this, then!

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.770
Dammit!

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.000
Falco?!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.670
Falco!

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:27.820
Dammit. I'm gonna...

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:29.090
Chief!

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:30.350
What?!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.360
Who're you?!

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:38.860
Stuck-up bastard! Get 'im!!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:00.710
Talk, you!!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:11.990
Falco!

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.370
<i>I love ya. Totally!</i>

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.770
And that's how we met.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:54.370
Ehh!

00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:00.040
Sograt Desert is this way!

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:04.350
Wait for us, please!

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:05.650
Wait!

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:10.290
We did it! It's the desert!

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:12.490
Yay!

00:22:12.490 --> 00:22:14.320
It's about time.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.300
<i>Fate.</i>

00:22:24.300 --> 00:22:29.330
<i>Fate brought Iruga to me, after all.</i>

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:33.310
<i>This is Glaris.</i>

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:38.010
<i>To Takius, her teacher's word</i> <i>is absolute. However...</i>

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:41.180
<i>Next time: "All For The Truth."</i>

00:23:41.180 --> 00:23:44.350
<i>Until we meet again...</i>
